abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo ({{SERIES_NAME_EN}}): a keyboard-first mind-map editor in which
  Enter / Tab create sibling and child nodes, a Markdown pane and the SVG map stay in two-way sync,
  three automatic layouts are overlap-free by construction, nodes can be dragged onto a new parent,
  and maps round-trip through Markdown, JSON, OPML and FreeMind .mm. Hand-written JavaScript, no
  libraries, no network; works on desktop and phones.
